  "system": {
    "subType": "classFeat",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a free action, the cleric may focus all his attention on casting a single spell. Only spells with a casting time of 1 standard action and a range of personal or touch may be cast in this way. The cleric adds his level to any concentration check made to cast a spell when using spell diligence. The cleric may use this ability a number of times per day equal to 3 + his Charisma modifier.</p>",
